{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is approached, take and process it. If not, move to object and scan area. Finally, execute specific task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = ProcessObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisual    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    />",
